@startuml
[*] --> CardInserted

state CardInserted
state AwaitingPIN
state PINVerified
state OptionsMenu
state ProcessingWithdrawal
state DispensingCash
state PrintingReceipt
state ReturningCard
state Resetting

CardInserted --> AwaitingPIN : Card inserted / prompt for PIN

AwaitingPIN --> PINVerified : PIN entered / verify PIN

PINVerified --> OptionsMenu : PIN verified / provide options

OptionsMenu --> ProcessingWithdrawal : Withdrawal selected / process request

ProcessingWithdrawal --> DispensingCash : Request approved / dispense cash

DispensingCash --> PrintingReceipt : Cash dispensed / print receipt

PrintingReceipt --> ReturningCard : Receipt printed / return card

ReturningCard --> Resetting : Card returned / reset system

Resetting --> [*] : System ready for next user
@enduml
